flowchart TD
    START([Question]) --> TRIAGE[Triage]
    TRIAGE -->|answerable / escalation| RETRIEVE[Local Retrieval]
    TRIAGE -->|clarification / out of scope| GENERATE[Response Generation]
    RETRIEVE --> GENERATE
    GENERATE --> VERIFY{Verification}
    VERIFY -->|pass| END([Structured response])
    VERIFY -->|fail, revision budget available| REVISE[Revision]
    REVISE --> VERIFY
    VERIFY -->|fail, budget exhausted| SAFE[Safe failure]